  "body": "## What changed\n\nPosts can declare `toolChangeMacros = { before: \"M100\\nM101\", after: \"M102\" }`.\nBoth fields are optional strings.\nThe engine emits the literal NC lines around the complete `onToolChange` hook.\nMacros run for the first tool and each tool-number change.\nRepeated tool numbers still reach the hook but do not repeat the macros.\nMacro lines belong to the TOOL record in the preview trace and line map.\nEmpty macros preserve the existing output.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe engine had no generic macro configuration around tool-change hooks.\nRepeated TOOL records can occur without a physical tool change.\nThe wrapper tracks tool numbers to avoid repeating macros for an unchanged tool.\n\n## Tests\n\nAll 11 pins in `crates/post/tests/tool_change_macros.rs` pass.\n\n- `post_macros_surround_every_tool_change_and_map_to_preview`\n- `empty_and_absent_macros_preserve_output`\n- `macro_object_type_refuses`\n- `macro_before_type_refuses`\n- `macro_after_type_refuses`\n- `macro_unknown_field_refuses`\n- `macro_before_controls_refuse`\n- `macro_after_controls_refuse`\n- `macro_lone_carriage_return_refuses`\n- `macro_text_is_literal_and_not_javascript`\n- `repeated_tool_records_preserve_hooks_without_repeating_change_macros`\n\nThe feature and refusal pins failed before the fix.\nThe empty-macro compatibility pin passed before and after the fix.\nRestoring the exact upstream engine made all 10 feature and refusal pins fail.\nRestoring the fix made all 11 pins pass.\nForcing macros on repeated tool numbers made the repeated-tool pin fail.\nRestoring the transition guard made all 11 pins pass.\n\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed all 134 steps.\n`cargo clippy -p camcraft-post --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed.\nThe self-check justified all six diff hunks.\n\n## Final-head verification\n\nRun on head `4b2f83fee5eee2487cbc9d2da3e47634709e54ed` against `upstream/main` at `e048b103ca649e24048268e1a050f0b4686a997a`.\n\n`cargo xtask gate heavy --base upstream/main`: PASS (exit 0), 184 steps, 0 failed, 33.7 minutes.\nThe reached lane was `app heavy: every target`, because app depends on the changed post engine.\nThe actual release `--ignored` runs passed 42 tests across the following 20 targets:\n\n| Heavy lane / target | Passed |\n|---|---:|\n| `app heavy: lib` | 1 |\n| `app heavy: adaptive_fig8_crossing` | 2 |\n| `app heavy: adaptive_pinch` | 1 |\n| `app heavy: carried_engine_agreement` | 1 |\n| `app heavy: feature_pick_wire` | 1 |\n| `app heavy: import_solidcraft` | 3 |\n| `app heavy: large_models` | 1 |\n| `app heavy: lathe_field_sim` | 1 |\n| `app heavy: lathe_workholding_kinds` | 1 |\n| `app heavy: operations` | 6 |\n| `app heavy: pick_agnostic` | 2 |\n| `app heavy: pocket3d_hsm` | 1 |\n| `app heavy: rotary_field_parity` | 6 |\n| `app heavy: shared_face_bodies_finish` | 6 |\n| `app heavy: shoulder_adaptive` | 1 |\n| `app heavy: stock_engine_agreement` | 3 |\n| `app heavy: stock_field_cost` | 1 |\n| `app heavy: stock_play_precalc` | 1 |\n| `app heavy: verify` | 2 |\n| `app heavy: whole_model_pocket` | 1 |\n\nThe other 162 ordinary targets ran zero ignored tests. No tests remained ignored in the heavy runs.\nThe 184 steps comprise one release build, 182 ordinary targets, and one separate known-fail probe.\nThe probe for `pocket3d_hsm::the_users_whole_model_bore_roughs_adaptive_on_each_level` (#1950) failed at its pinned assertion as expected. The gate validated that expected failure; it is not counted as a passing test.\n\n`CAMCRAFT_GATE_JOBS=2 cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: PASS (exit 0), 134 steps, 1,081 tests passed, 1 existing test ignored, 13.6 minutes.\nThe ignored quick test, `lathe_workholding_kinds::every_slow_kind_on_a_mill_turn_keeps_the_work_spindle_within_the_chuck`, actually ran and passed in the heavy lane.\n\n`RUSTC_WRAPPER=sccache cargo clippy -j 6 -p camcraft-post --all-targets -- -D warnings`: PASS (exit 0).\n\nThis addresses the missing run evidence. No source, test, golden, process, or dependency file changed.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone.\nThe new tests contain exact expected NC strings.\n`git diff --stat upstream/main -- '*.nc' '*.cl'` produced no output.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nCNC hardware and the desktop UI were not exercised.\nThis change supports post configuration only.\nMachine-file configuration needs parser, mirror and persistence changes.\nCustom posts that force a physical change for the same tool number need a separate placement contract.\nThe post author must choose valid controller instructions and a safe sequence.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone found for the five changed files.\n\nEffort: high.\n\nChangelog: Posts can emit validated pre- and post-tool-change macros with preview trace attribution.\n\nFixes #2407\n",
